OL,3,AStacey Solomon and Alesha Dixon to host
OL,4,AThe Voice UK in ITV revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlesha Dixon and Stacey Solomon are to
OL,7,Fhost The Voice UK as part of a revamp
OL,8,Fof the show announced by ITV.
OL,10,FThe pair replace Emma Willis, who has
OL,11,Fpresented the singing contest since
OL,12,F2014 but recently left to front the
OL,13,FBBC's Strictly Come Dancing.
OL,15,FITV also confirmed earlier reports that
OL,16,Fsinger Cheryl and rapper Aitch will
OL,17,Fjoin the The Voice as coaches, sitting
OL,18,Fin the show's famous giant red chairs.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
