OL,3,AStacey Solomon and Alesha Dixon to host
OL,4,AThe Voice UK in ITV revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Sir Tom Jones said
OL,7,Fearlier this week that he had been
OL,8,Fremoved from the series despite wanting
OL,9,Fto stay, over an insurance issue.
